Column name: Origin Type: STRING Description: blank about half the time, otherwise 'L'
Column name: PatientID Type: STRING Description: unknown/unnecessary field -- always blank
Column name: PatientName Type: STRING Description: unknown/unnecessary field -- always blank
Column name: CaseOrder Type: INT64 Description: unknown integer field between 0 and 991807
